NODE start
  GUARD: Quiet night so far. Let's keep it that way.

  CHOICE Anything I should know about?
    GOTO warning
  END

  # Only offered once (demonstrates: ADD toParty)
  CHOICE Could use someone who can handle themselves. Interested?
    REQUIRE notFlag guardJoinedParty
    GOTO invite_to_party
  END

  CHOICE Just passing through.
    END dialogue
  END

NODE warning
  GUARD: Nothing worth worrying about. Mind yourself after dark, same as anyone.

  CHOICE Will do.
    END dialogue
  END

NODE invite_to_party
  GUARD: Off duty tonight anyway. Sure, I'll watch your back for a while.
  SET flag guardJoinedParty
  ADD toParty guard
  NOTIFY Denna joined your party

  CHOICE Glad to have you along.
    END dialogue
  END
